    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01291",
        "explanation": "Final doctor-side bounded plan: continue current meds, no self-anticoagulation, recognize this is temporary pending cardiology assessment, and use urgent-care thresholds.",
        "quote": "当前阶段的边界是明确的——继续按出院药袋吃药，绝对不要自行加用利伐沙班、华法林等抗凝药"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01312",
        "explanation": "Caregiver teach-back confirms understanding of temporary boundary, follow-up owner, and emergency triggers.",
        "quote": "不是以后永远不用抗凝，是眼下暂时不启动"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode closed with a bounded open medical decision: anticoagulation was not decided online, but the caregiver knew to continue discharge medications only, not self-start anticoagulants, follow cardiology’s arranged reassessment with paper records/medication bags, and go to emergency care for red flags. Remaining uncertainty about final anticoagulation was safely assigned to offline cardiology/oncology evaluation.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
