      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by persistent fear that bleeding risk and temporary non-prescribing meant anticoagulation should simply be ignored. The doctor repeatedly corrected this without blaming the family, explained that stroke prevention and bleeding risk both require specialist balancing, linked it to cardiology/oncology follow-up, and obtained caregiver teach-back.",
