        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by uncertain family readings of medication bags and paper notes. The doctor distinguished verified from unverified information, directed in-person medication-bag verification and exact document-field reading, and kept the plan safe while verification was pending.",
