        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01001",
          "explanation": "Doctor offered a feasible route and fallback for access barriers.",
          "quote": "优先去心内科门诊现场加号"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered when the caregiver worried about appointment access and the burden of repeated hospital trips. The doctor gave practical channels—cardiology phone/onsite add-on, special-needs/urgent window, emergency care for red flags—with time-bounded escalation, making the follow-up realistically executable.",
